{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19532","headline":"山亭怀古 · 张弘靖","name":"山亭怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丛石依古城，悬泉洒清池。\n高低袤丈内，衡霍相蔽亏。\n归田竟何因，爲郡岂所宜。\n谁能辨人野，寄适聊在斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张弘靖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}